+### Split the develop PROJECT_FACTS sd-command table per role (fabro-a3ff)
+Factor the PROJECT_FACTS sd-command include per role: planner keeps the full claim/close/re-status table; implementer keeps only `sd show`; reviewer drops the tracker table. Evidence: the implementer prompt (~13 KB) carried the full sd command table plus failure anecdotes for operations it is forbidden to perform ("Do NOT claim, close, or re-status seeds"), and the reviewer carried the same table for operations it never performs. Expected effect: ~1–2 KB less prompt per stage and a smaller behavioral surface.
